    "body": "This should be equivalent. Both the overloaded and union-type versions would throw if zero arguments are passed and would coerce the first argument. And any non-Function, non-String value passed as the first argument will select the DOMString overload (in the overloaded version) and be converted to the DOMString part of the union type (in the union version).\n",
